// Canonical physical keys: C suffix, Rust variant, stable wire ID, browser code,
// macOS virtual key code, sided modifier mask. IDs are append-only.
// macOS codes: HIToolbox/Events.h; masks: IOKit/hidsystem/IOLLEvent.h
// NX_DEVICE*KEYMASK. 65535 means no native mapping; 0 means a regular key.
// Lock keys and Fn are excluded because their flags do not represent held state.
